seccomp-default.json is the default system-call filter of the Docker engine, copied
unchanged from the repository github.com/moby/profiles, file seccomp/default.json, at
commit a0fa70805f742f7da15b367770d802ea2a86c68b (fetched 2026-11-25). Its SHA-256 is
3320527d4568265ac97a077609b1bfd4cfd0d789eeb9239b7e094b1526675406, and
tools/copy_test.py refuses to use it when the file no longer has that hash.

